# "All skills:", source, sort and enchantment dropdowns); hover the enchantment box (the BODY
# tooltip: enchantItem of the selection), drop it, hover and pick the second entry; sort by the
# second "Sort by" entry (applySort: getSortValue through the calc for every entry, table.sort,
# UpdateSearch, SetSel(1, true)); tick "All skills:" (buildSkillList, SetSel on the skill
# dropdown); pick the second source (buildEnchantmentList, the clamped SetSel, applySort);
